{
  "inShort": "The goal is at risk: the devlog media show no playable slice, so implementation progress is unknown. No build or five-player test results landed; the reported second island and reef damage remain unverified. Mia did not confirm work this week and has no stated hours, leaving programming capacity for tides and co-op sailing uncertain.",
  "discussed": [
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtk5ck20878nxz83y518y2v",
      "text": "The inspected repository matches the promised public Godot demos. This task remains done, but those demos do not prove the game's playable slice."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtk5cqc0879nxz85jnxahxg",
      "text": "The reference remains marked done. Its title and thumbnail identify Big Buck Bunny, not footage of this game. The video was not watched, so its animated style could not be verified."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtk5csp087anxz8imt6azre",
      "text": "The inspected article explains playtesting and matches the promised reference. This task remains done; reading material does not establish that five players tested the slice."
    }
  ],
  "notDiscussed": [
    "cmvtk5cx1087enxz8u5txutxh"
  ],
  "outsidePlan": [
    "The devlog reports a second island and reef damage. These would advance the slice, but the landscape image and film thumbnail demonstrate neither. No accessible evidence shows the tide loop or two-player boat crewing."
  ],
  "questions": [
    "Does a playable build currently contain both islands, the tide loop and two-player boat crewing?",
    "Have five players tested that build, and where are their findings recorded?",
    "What programming hours can Mia confirm for the remaining two weeks?"
  ]
}

